OL,3,AKing Charles shows off dance moves on
OL,4,Asecond day of Caribbean tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe King shook off royal formality and
OL,7,Freplaced it with some dance moves on
OL,8,Fthe second day of his nine-day visit to
OL,9,Fthe Caribbean.
OL,11,FArmed with a pair of maracas in the
OL,12,Fcolours of the flag of the Bahamas,
OL,13,FCharles joined a Junkanoo - a cultural
OL,14,Fevent and carnival designed to
OL,15,Fcelebrate island life.
OL,17,FAmidst the feathered headdresses and
OL,18,Fbrightly coloured costumes in the
OL,19,Fafternoon Caribbean heat, the King,
OL,20,Fdressed in a suit and sunglasses,
OL,21,Fjoined dancers at the front of parade
OL,22,Fto cheers from the crowd.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
