OL,3,AKing Charles shows off dance moves on
OL,4,Asecond day of Caribbean tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was a lighter mood coming after the
OL,7,FKing's arrival on Tuesday where he
OL,8,Fdelivered a speech acknowledging the
OL,9,Fpain of the slave trade, describing
OL,10,F"the suffering of the past".
